===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:bor|frm:conférence<ety:inh<la-med:cōnferentia>>}}
From {{bor|en|frm|conférence}}, from {{der|en|la-med|cōnferentia}}, from {{der|en|la|cōnferēns}}, omitting several steps, from {{m|la|con-}} + {{m|la|ferō}}.

Compare parallel {{cog|ru|собра́ние}}, {{cog|ru|сбо́рище}}, akin to {{m|ru|с-}}, {{m|ru|со-}} + {{m|ru|брать}}, ultimately from the same Indo-European prefix and root. Also compare {{m|en|congress}}, {{m|en|convention}}.

